selm'a o isn't a "base", though... it's the lujvo form of se cmavo .
 "cmavrza'o" is of a class we call "zi'evla" ("free word"), which are
lojban short forms that resemble fu'ivla, but come from strictly lojbanic
roots.
        --gejyspa


