>> construction would be to combine words with the base "selma'o".
>>
>> Perhaps like:
>> temci (time interval) + selma'o (structure word class)
>> =3D temselma'o
>> =3D the class of structure words concerned with time intervals
>> =3D "ZEhA" (I think?)
>>
